Cinnarchy — Omarchy Theme Picker for Cinnamon

Cinnarchy is an independent project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Omarchy, Basecamp, 37signals or Linux Mint.

The Cinnamon shell stylesheet and its accompanying assets in data/themes and
data/template are derived from the Cinnamon 6.6.9 default theme, copyright the
Cinnamon/GNOME Shell contributors, under the GNU General Public License
version 2 or later. Palette colors and additional styling were substituted on
2026-11-10.
Source: https://github.com/linuxmint/cinnamon/tree/master/data/theme

The bundled palette data (data/themes/*/palette.json and manifest.json) is
copied from Omarchy 4.5.0, copyright David Heinemeier Hansson and contributors,
under the MIT license. Its permission notice is reproduced in OMARCHY-LICENSE.
src/generator.cpp ports Omarchy's palette fallback rules and alacritty.toml
reader (bin/omarchy-theme-color, bin/omarchy-theme-colors-from-alacritty)
from the same MIT-licensed project.
Source: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy

The GTK stylesheet imports the installed GTK 3.24 Adwaita resource at runtime;
GTK itself and the Adwaita resources are not redistributed.

No wallpaper, font, icon pack or cursor theme is included in this repository.
Wallpapers come from an installed Omarchy, from themes the user downloads, or
from the omarchy-theme-backgrounds package that bin/package-deb builds locally
from Omarchy's own repository.
